#
# Oden Streamer project for the robot: one 1280x720 camera, sent over one link
# to the operator's workstation on UDP port 47000. From the repository root,
# put the workstation's address in a copy and start the Streamer without a
# window:
#
#   sed 's/OPERATOR_IP/192.168.1.20/' examples/teleop_oden/oden/robot.vproj > ~/robot.vproj
#   oden-streamer --headless --project ~/robot.vproj
#
# The camera is a test pattern. For a real camera, set `pipeline` to a
# GStreamer pipeline that ends in 1280x720 RGBA; the teleop_oden README shows
# one for Jetson cameras, and how to add cameras and links.
config : {
    scene_manager : {
        next_scene_id : 1;
        scenes : ( {
                scene_id : 0;
                uuid : "18655dae-32f1-4343-ab02-e2e001b905de";
                root_entity : {
                    uuid : "f53cc36b-4fc3-4607-66d4-00cedcdfef49";
                    children : ( {
                            uuid : "5e11f5fb-8a2d-413d-1778-4f435bd3bade";
                            type : "output_alignment";
                            children : ( {
                                    id : "forward";
                                    uuid : "6664c23d-6341-4cd5-0375-60279a10571f";
                                    position : [ -2.58588, 0.140537, -5.0 ];
                                    scale : [ 1.911303, 1.911303, 1.911303 ];
                                    type : "panorama_video";
                                    pv : {
                                        type : "flat_video_config";
                                        output_alignment_data : {
                                            id : 1;
                                        };
                                        streams : ( {
                                            id : 1;
                                            uuid : "5276acbc-c226-44d3-2d8c-a66e46288074";
                                            type : "video";
                                            width : 1280;
                                            height : 720;
                                            capture : {
                                                impl : "gstreamer";
                                                pipeline : "videotestsrc pattern=smpte horizontal-speed=4 ! video/x-raw, width=1280, height=720, framerate=30/1";
                                                pixel_format : "rgba";
                                                use_nvdec : false;
                                                use_sync : true;
                                            };
                                        } );
                                    };
                                } );
                        } );
                };
            } );
    };
    stream_settings : {
        bandwidth_control : {
            use_fec : true;
            fec_min_extra_packets : 1;
            high : {
                bytes_in_flight_pid : {
                    target : 0.5;
                };
            };
        };
        type : "realtime_nvenc_gstreamer";
        streamer_max_fps : 70.0;
        sync_to_video_source : true;
        sync_video_source_id : "5276acbc-c226-44d3-2d8c-a66e46288074";
        net_settings : {
            links : ( {
                    uuid : "342f3136-7e7a-44c8-696c-dc17c97e095b";
                    name : "operator";
                    mode : "sender";
                    destination_ip : "OPERATOR_IP";
                    destination_port : 47000;
                    p2p_settings : {
                        enable : false;
                    };
                } );
        };
        encoder_settings : {
            use_custom_resolution : true;
            width : 1280;
            height : 720;
            frame_rate : "f_r_60";
            bitrate : 1000000L;
            color_format : "y_cb_cr_hd_full";
            intra_refresh : true;
            codec : "hevc";
            preset : "low_latency_high_performance";
            rate_control_mode : "cbr";
        };
    };
    background_behaviour : "hide";
};
